WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.325 --> 00:39.837
=Episode 21=

00:39.885 --> 00:42.600
(Bullying My Women?
I'll Blow Up the Great Clans!)

00:43.560 --> 00:44.399
Sit down.

00:44.760 --> 00:45.839
Sit down and talk.

00:52.960 --> 00:54.199
Young Madam Lin,

00:54.880 --> 00:56.279
by doing this,

00:56.640 --> 01:00.079
you will only put the Wei clan
in a dangerous position.

01:00.239 --> 01:02.079
You cannot let this marriage

01:02.079 --> 01:05.199
ruin the future of the entire Wei clan.

01:07.399 --> 01:08.399
Clan Leader Wei,

01:09.280 --> 01:12.079
for a rebellious
descendant like Wei Hao,

01:12.679 --> 01:14.440
your clan doesn't expel him?

01:14.640 --> 01:16.159
What are your thoughts?

01:16.359 --> 01:18.479
Come up with a formal plan.

01:18.759 --> 01:21.280
How do you want
the Wei clan to handle this?

01:21.799 --> 01:24.000
Now that this has happened,

01:24.000 --> 01:25.799
none of us wants to see this.

01:26.479 --> 01:28.439
But your continued aggression

01:28.439 --> 01:29.679
is not the answer.

01:30.679 --> 01:33.439
This ultimately needs to be resolved.

01:34.320 --> 01:35.200
On this matter,

01:35.359 --> 01:37.280
we still need to ask
our Clan Leaders' opinion.

01:38.039 --> 01:38.759
However,

01:39.119 --> 01:41.479
if Wei Hao can call off the engagement,

01:41.520 --> 01:43.560
I will treat this
as if it never happened

01:43.920 --> 01:44.920
and let it go.

01:47.040 --> 01:47.840
That's impossible.

01:51.920 --> 01:52.920
What did you say?

01:54.480 --> 01:55.159
Well,

01:56.680 --> 01:58.120
we will take our leave now.

01:59.400 --> 02:01.840
I hope the Wei clan
handles this properly.

02:02.439 --> 02:03.599
Otherwise, Clan Leader Wei,

02:04.599 --> 02:05.760
you should know

02:05.959 --> 02:07.079
how we will treat

02:07.079 --> 02:08.680
those members of the Wei clan.

02:27.000 --> 02:27.799
Lin Luo,

02:29.159 --> 02:31.159
do you really want me

02:31.159 --> 02:33.959
to expel all of you from the clan?

02:35.079 --> 02:37.200
You'd better think this through.

02:40.519 --> 02:41.319
It's fine.

02:41.799 --> 02:44.000
Hao and I have already moved out anyway,

02:44.239 --> 02:46.400
so it's no different
from being expelled.

02:46.400 --> 02:49.040
You should still be
more cautious about this.

02:50.200 --> 02:51.560
What is there to be cautious about?

02:53.400 --> 02:54.759
My brother-in-law's eight sisters

02:54.800 --> 02:56.120
and Hao's eight sisters

02:56.280 --> 02:57.719
listened to your advice

02:57.719 --> 02:59.700
and married into
remote branches of these great clans.

02:59.719 --> 03:01.319
Not only do they live in poverty,

03:01.400 --> 03:02.879
but we can't even look after them.

03:03.199 --> 03:04.960
To visit them, we have to go to Bashu.

03:05.240 --> 03:06.960
A round trip takes over a year.

03:07.130 --> 03:09.070
They'd be better off
married here in the capital.

03:09.439 --> 03:10.240
Cautious?

03:10.840 --> 03:11.599
Regardless,

03:11.840 --> 03:13.599
no one's advice will work this time.

03:13.840 --> 03:15.319
Don't you realize

03:15.560 --> 03:16.520
that if this matter

03:16.520 --> 03:18.840
dissatisfies the other clans,

03:19.120 --> 03:21.599
all of Wei Hao's sisters and aunts

03:21.800 --> 03:24.240
might be divorced and sent away?

03:27.439 --> 03:28.120
What?

03:29.919 --> 03:30.960
How shameless!

03:31.639 --> 03:32.639
Well,

03:32.879 --> 03:34.520
it's not impossible.

03:34.800 --> 03:35.960
After all, Wei Hao

03:36.080 --> 03:38.800
was the first to break
the agreement between the great clans.

03:39.919 --> 03:40.759
Clan Leader Wei,

03:41.479 --> 03:43.240
is this how these great clans do things?

03:43.240 --> 03:44.590
They have no sense of reason at all.

03:45.280 --> 03:46.520
No wonder Hao

03:46.520 --> 03:48.560
has no respect for the great clans.

03:49.719 --> 03:51.560
Go back and talk sense into Wei Hao.

03:51.840 --> 03:53.759
He can't let all the female relatives

03:53.960 --> 03:56.280
of his own clan be divorced

03:56.280 --> 03:58.280
just because he wants to get married.

04:19.387 --> 04:21.987
(Wei Hao's Banquet)

04:25.520 --> 04:26.319
Aunt?

04:33.390 --> 04:34.280
Is something wrong?

04:38.639 --> 04:41.240
I just came from
the Clan Leader's place.

04:42.360 --> 04:43.280
The great clans

04:43.479 --> 04:45.520
are dissatisfied with the fact
that you are getting

04:45.560 --> 04:46.840
engaged to the Eldest Princess.

04:47.719 --> 04:48.520
Hao,

04:48.919 --> 04:49.800
regarding this matter,

04:49.800 --> 04:51.520
you really need to
consider it carefully.

04:51.560 --> 04:52.879
What does it have to do with them?

04:53.000 --> 04:54.500
You don't need to pay them any mind.

04:56.610 --> 04:58.500
It's true that it has
nothing to do with them.

04:59.199 --> 05:00.959
But if you don't
call off the engagement,

05:01.480 --> 05:02.839
your sisters

05:03.079 --> 05:04.399
will likely be divorced.

05:07.399 --> 05:08.720
Including your father's sisters,

05:09.160 --> 05:10.319
your aunts,

05:10.519 --> 05:11.839
they could all be divorced.

05:13.360 --> 05:14.120
They wouldn't dare!

05:14.120 --> 05:14.759
Hao,

05:14.759 --> 05:16.399
I didn't expect them to do this either.

05:16.399 --> 05:19.000
But if we don't call off the engagement,
they really will do it.

05:23.839 --> 05:24.759
I'm going to find them.

05:25.680 --> 05:26.920
What's the use in finding them?

05:26.920 --> 05:28.279
Are you going to give them a beating?

05:28.279 --> 05:29.319
Give them a beating?

05:29.319 --> 05:30.839
Beating them would
be letting them off easy!

05:30.839 --> 05:32.079
I'm going to the Ministry
of Works for gunpowder.

05:32.079 --> 05:33.360
I'm going to blow them all!

05:33.500 --> 05:35.500
How dare they bully
the women of the Wei clan?

05:35.920 --> 05:37.240
Just because I'm getting married,

05:37.240 --> 05:39.079
they forced all
the women already married out

05:39.079 --> 05:40.120
of the Wei clan to be divorced?

05:40.120 --> 05:41.199
How can I stand for this?

05:41.519 --> 05:42.199
Hao,

05:42.199 --> 05:43.480
don't be impulsive!

05:44.360 --> 05:45.279
Don't worry, Aunt.

05:45.439 --> 05:46.360
Believe it or not,

05:46.399 --> 05:47.720
even if I blow up the mansions

05:47.730 --> 05:49.920
of those great clans'
representatives in the capital,

05:49.920 --> 05:51.510
they'll still have to come and beg me.

05:51.560 --> 05:52.439
If they don't,

05:53.319 --> 05:55.360
I'll uproot their great clans entirely!

05:55.360 --> 05:58.000
I'll make sure that within ten years,
the term "great clan" no longer exists.

05:58.000 --> 05:58.399
I...

05:58.399 --> 05:59.160
Hao!

05:59.680 --> 06:00.439
Let go of me.

06:00.439 --> 06:01.120
Let go.

06:01.120 --> 06:02.439
No, I can blow them up
and get away with it.

06:02.439 --> 06:03.439
I'm not stupid.

06:03.439 --> 06:04.279
Hao,

06:04.360 --> 06:05.920
think twice before you act.

06:11.199 --> 06:12.000
Aunt,

06:12.839 --> 06:14.839
let me handle things
my own way this time.

06:15.199 --> 06:17.720
I'm going to pin them all to the ground

06:18.160 --> 06:20.279
and then make them beg for my help.

06:20.639 --> 06:21.439
Hao,

06:22.199 --> 06:23.759
you cannot lie to me.

06:24.160 --> 06:25.680
If they really go through with this,

06:25.680 --> 06:27.360
worst case,
I'll give every woman in our clan

06:27.360 --> 06:28.920
one hundred mu of land and a mansion.

06:29.300 --> 06:31.240
But if anything happens to you,
what am I supposed to do?

06:31.240 --> 06:32.240
Aunt,

06:33.240 --> 06:34.319
my father-in-law

06:34.519 --> 06:36.120
is His Majesty, the Emperor.

06:36.120 --> 06:37.040
What can they do to me?

06:37.040 --> 06:38.320
Do you think I'm afraid of them?

06:38.639 --> 06:40.120
That's how great clans are.

06:40.120 --> 06:42.180
If you take a step back,
they'll push even further.

06:42.199 --> 06:44.079
Wasn't it the same
with my glaze business?

06:44.720 --> 06:45.240
Even now,

06:45.240 --> 06:46.800
I still won't sell anything to them.

06:47.319 --> 06:48.199
Just stay

06:48.240 --> 06:49.120
out of this.

06:49.680 --> 06:50.480
Hao.

06:53.079 --> 06:54.000
Follow Young Master.

06:54.000 --> 06:54.680
Don't let him start a fight.

06:54.680 --> 06:55.040
Go now.

06:55.040 --> 06:55.519
Yes.

06:55.812 --> 06:57.425
(Ganlu Palace)

06:59.240 --> 07:00.560
Zhangsun Ying

07:00.759 --> 07:03.319
wants six months off for a minor injury?

07:03.879 --> 07:04.680
In my view,

07:04.759 --> 07:07.600
he's just holding a grudge
because I betrothed Ning'an to Wei Hao.

07:16.087 --> 07:19.662
(Great Master)

07:21.199 --> 07:22.160
The great clans

07:22.280 --> 07:23.839
haven't moved against Wei Hao, right?

07:24.000 --> 07:24.800
No.

07:25.199 --> 07:27.040
There's no movement yet.

07:27.439 --> 07:28.240
However,

07:28.839 --> 07:31.040
those representatives of
the great clans in the capital

07:31.480 --> 07:33.560
went to Wei Yuanzhao's
mansion yesterday.

07:34.439 --> 07:36.000
Young Madam Lin went as well.

07:36.010 --> 07:37.350
They couldn't reach an agreement.

07:37.360 --> 07:39.319
Young Madam Lin
refused to call off the wedding.

07:39.800 --> 07:41.800
But on the great clans' side,

07:42.160 --> 07:44.000
it is highly likely they will force

07:44.519 --> 07:47.240
divorces for the women
married out from Wei Hao's family.

07:47.439 --> 07:48.160
What?

07:49.959 --> 07:51.519
Would the great clans really do that?

07:51.959 --> 07:53.079
I believe

07:53.920 --> 07:54.519
they would.

07:55.639 --> 07:57.879
They must give Wei Hao a warning.

07:58.680 --> 07:59.600
At the same time,

08:00.079 --> 08:01.680
they want Your Majesty to know

08:02.079 --> 08:03.199
that this matter

08:03.199 --> 08:05.319
isn't just between
Wei Hao and the Princess.

08:05.319 --> 08:06.279
It is also between

08:06.720 --> 08:08.040
the great clans and Your Majesty.

08:09.759 --> 08:10.680
If they fail

08:10.759 --> 08:12.920
to stop the two of them
from marrying this time,

08:13.040 --> 08:14.079
it would prove

08:14.319 --> 08:16.519
that the great clans have been

08:17.040 --> 08:18.439
completely defeated by Your Majesty.

08:19.000 --> 08:22.040
This is something those
clan leaders do not want to see.

08:22.480 --> 08:23.279
Correct.

08:24.000 --> 08:25.839
They will try to pressure Wei Hao.

08:26.319 --> 08:27.800
But I didn't expect

08:28.000 --> 08:29.399
them to be this shameless.

08:30.720 --> 08:31.879
Those women

08:31.879 --> 08:33.319
are all innocent.

08:33.319 --> 08:34.319
Some of them

08:34.319 --> 08:36.079
have been married for decades.

08:36.120 --> 08:37.160
For them to do this,

08:37.199 --> 08:38.439
this is...

08:39.160 --> 08:40.800
It's shameless.

08:41.279 --> 08:44.000
Wei Hao is a very filial child.

08:44.240 --> 08:45.839
If the women of his family

08:45.879 --> 08:47.319
were to suffer such insults,

08:47.680 --> 08:48.720
I feel

08:49.390 --> 08:50.920
that he likely wouldn't stand for it.

08:52.120 --> 08:53.160
I didn't expect

08:53.800 --> 08:55.759
the great clans to use such a method

08:55.759 --> 08:57.319
to put pressure on Wei Hao.

08:57.319 --> 08:58.079
This matter

08:58.480 --> 08:59.600
depends on Wei Hao.

08:59.879 --> 09:01.519
But in my humble opinion,

09:02.319 --> 09:04.199
I'm afraid Wei Hao can't hold out.

09:39.679 --> 09:40.679
(Cui Mansion)
Open up!

09:41.440 --> 09:42.240
Who is it?

09:42.639 --> 09:43.639
Me.

09:44.320 --> 09:45.519
Marquis Wei.

09:46.120 --> 09:47.000
Wait a moment.

09:47.010 --> 09:48.480
I'll go inform the head of the house.

09:48.480 --> 09:49.600
Inform, my foot.

09:53.519 --> 09:54.840
I'll give you one first

09:55.159 --> 09:56.840
without the iron filings.

09:58.559 --> 09:59.440
Everyone inside,

10:00.120 --> 10:01.279
get back.

10:01.840 --> 10:03.320
If you get hurt later,

10:03.759 --> 10:05.600
don't say I didn't warn you.

10:18.775 --> 10:19.312
(Zhuque Gate)

10:19.360 --> 10:20.360
What was that sound?

10:20.520 --> 10:21.960
- What happened?
- What happened?

10:22.025 --> 10:23.487
(Zhuque Gate)

10:25.840 --> 10:28.480
Is the Ministry of Works
testing gunpowder?

10:28.500 --> 10:30.399
Didn't I tell them to
test it outside the city?

10:30.480 --> 10:31.679
Your Majesty,

10:31.679 --> 10:33.720
the Imperial Guards will go and inquire.

10:45.820 --> 10:46.360
What's wrong?

10:46.360 --> 10:47.240
Master!

10:47.240 --> 10:47.960
What's going on?

10:47.960 --> 10:49.159
Please come out and see.

10:49.159 --> 10:49.799
The main gate...

10:49.799 --> 10:50.279
The main gate was...

10:50.279 --> 10:50.799
Just say it.

10:50.799 --> 10:51.159
It was...

10:51.320 --> 10:52.679
Right after that massive bang,

10:52.840 --> 10:54.039
the gate opened.

10:54.240 --> 10:55.159
What?

11:00.240 --> 11:00.799
How...

11:01.080 --> 11:02.159
How did my gate...

11:22.262 --> 11:25.092
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

11:25.712 --> 11:29.112
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

11:29.882 --> 11:32.832
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

11:33.172 --> 11:35.872
♪Sigh and walk away♪

11:37.472 --> 11:40.942
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

11:40.942 --> 11:43.172
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

11:43.172 --> 11:45.282
♪Colors and darkness♪

11:45.282 --> 11:47.302
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

11:47.302 --> 11:51.662
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

11:53.102 --> 11:56.832
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

11:57.102 --> 12:00.702
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

12:00.862 --> 12:02.942
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

12:02.942 --> 12:07.732
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

12:07.952 --> 12:09.572
♪The world mistakes me♪

12:09.572 --> 12:11.912
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

12:11.982 --> 12:13.172
♪As the storm approaches♪

12:13.172 --> 12:15.572
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

12:15.782 --> 12:17.502
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

12:17.502 --> 12:19.482
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

12:19.652 --> 12:21.402
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

12:21.402 --> 12:23.502
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

12:23.502 --> 12:24.972
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

12:24.972 --> 12:27.202
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

12:27.422 --> 12:28.622
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

12:28.622 --> 12:31.142
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

12:31.272 --> 12:32.982
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

12:32.982 --> 12:34.262
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

12:34.412 --> 12:35.832
♪My wish has finally come true♪

12:35.832 --> 12:36.872
♪To stay by your side♪

12:36.872 --> 12:38.792
♪In this fleeting world♪

12:38.962 --> 12:42.212
♪We are free and happy♪

12:46.212 --> 12:47.992
♪From a nobody♪

12:47.992 --> 12:49.892
♪To someone now famous♪

12:50.002 --> 12:51.432
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

12:51.432 --> 12:53.942
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

12:54.042 --> 12:55.622
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

12:55.622 --> 12:57.692
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

12:57.902 --> 12:59.582
♪In this vast world♪

12:59.582 --> 13:01.582
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

13:01.732 --> 13:03.942
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

13:03.942 --> 13:05.532
♪Everything ends eventually♪

13:05.622 --> 13:07.122
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

13:07.122 --> 13:09.522
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

13:09.522 --> 13:11.232
♪No matter how time flies♪

13:11.232 --> 13:12.392
♪Even if the falling snow♪

13:12.392 --> 13:14.022
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

13:14.022 --> 13:15.062
♪All I want now♪

13:15.062 --> 13:17.162
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

13:17.162 --> 13:20.422
♪Year after year♪
